        "en": "Many pet owners praise the veterinary team and front desk staff for their warm, compassionate demeanor during routine examinations and urgent walk-in visits. Several longtime clients commend doctors who listen carefully and accommodate late arrivals. While occasional reviews note feeling rushed, the overall atmosphere remains friendly and supportive."
