      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight successful medical outcomes when addressing sudden injuries such as torn nails, skin irritations, and annual wellness checks. Reviewers emphasize that clinical interventions promptly stabilize their animals, with veterinarians clearly walking through diagnosis and recovery plans."
      }
    },
