      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for nervous companions"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents note that technicians and veterinarians treat dogs and cats with patience, helping ease anxiety during exams. The team takes time to remember individual pets and create a comforting environment, which reassures owners bringing in timid animals for nail trims or medical procedures."
      }
    }
